  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><p>Pinaverium is a calcium channel blocker used to treat functional gastrointestinal disorders such as irritable bowel syndrome. It is an approved drug, but it is not authorised in the European Union and appears to be used only in a limited number of countries.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1236146&quot;>Wikidata Q1236146</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>pinaverium</td></tr><tr><td>ATC codes:</td><td>A03AX04</td></tr><tr><td>DrugBank:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://go.drugbank.com/drugs/DB09090&quot;>DB09090</a></td></tr><tr><td>PubChem CID:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/40704&quot;>40704</a></td></tr><tr><td>ChEBI:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/searchId.do?chebiId=CHEBI:135811&quot;>135811</a></td></tr><tr><td>Wikidata:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1236146&quot;>Q1236146</a></td></tr><tr><td>formula:</td><td>C26H41BrNO4+</td></tr><tr><td>molar mass:</td><td>511.521 g/mol (PubChem)</td></tr></table></body></html>"));
